meta {
  name: Get All Driver Name
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/driver/name
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Driver Name

  This request is used to get all driver name. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Driver fetched successfully.** Ordered in ascending order by `fullname`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "driver fetched",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
        "username": "jhondoe",
        "fullname": "Jhon Doe"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — driver failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "driver not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}